XFAIL: system-linux, system-darwin

A child started with an almost empty environment, as `env -i` or a
sandboxing build tool does, still runs through catter.
Known failures: #120 (catter-proxy needs HOME).

RUN: %e2e probe scrubbed-env | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe scrubbed-env | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS scrubbed-env
